See also: S:\IT_Helpdesk\New_Hire_IT_Checklist.txt (helpdesk-facing).

FILE SERVER (ww-fs01) - standalone Samba, local accounts
  Groups -> shares:
    engineering   Engineering (read/write)
    eng_ro        Engineering (read only)
    itstaff       IT$ (read/write), Public (write)
    wq            Public (write)
    hr            HR (read/write)
    everyone      Public (read)
  New user:
    sudo useradd -M -s /usr/sbin/nologin -G <groups> <user>
    sudo smbpasswd -a <user>
  Review group membership quarterly:  getent group eng_ro engineering hr
    ** Q3 review not done. eng_ro still has svc_ccrsync from INC-2291. **

IT ADMIN SERVER (ww-it01) - local accounts
  sudo useradd -m -s /bin/bash -G helpdesk <user>      (helpdesk staff)
  sudo useradd -m -s /bin/bash -G itstaff <user>       (IT admins)
  echo '<user>:WaterWorks<YYYY>!' | sudo chpasswd
  TODO (IT-1182): add `sudo chage -d 0 <user>` here once the PAM change is
  tested. Until then the user keeps the temp password until they change it.

OT ACCESS - not provisioned by IT. Engineering adds keys on ww-jump01.

DEPROVISIONING (same day as separation)
  - Disable M365, remove from groups, `sudo usermod -L -e 1 <user>` on Linux
    servers, `sudo smbpasswd -d <user>` on ww-fs01.
  - Recover laptop/phone/badge.
